[* 
path.rdn
Copyright (c) 2023-2026 Ray Den
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

Purpose:
Cross-platform path helpers over the native path module.

Loading behavior:
This module chooses the shared-library suffix from __sharedlib_ext and loads:
../nativelibs/path(.so|.dylib|.dll)

Exports:
- join      : left right -> path
- basename  : path -> final component
- dirname   : path -> parent directory
- extname   : path -> extension or null
- absolute  : path -> boolean
*]

"../nativelibs/path" __sharedlib_ext to_string swap pop append loadnative

join defun
    joinPath call
end

basename defun
    baseName call
end

dirname defun
    dirName call
end

extname defun
    extName call
end

absolute defun
    isAbsolutePath call
end
